<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman ups CU, GRE.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman ups CU, GRE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>British insurance groups Guardian Royal Exchange Plc and Commercial Union Plc were raised to &quot;market outperformers&quot; from &quot;market performers&quot; at Goldman Sachs, the investment bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>Futher detail was not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
